{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（26日）播出的TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》最終回，賴慰玲（Winki）帶住囝囝也也深入婆羅州熱帶雨林，執 …</p><p></p>\n<p>昨晚（26日）播出的TVB節目《玩住學。學住玩》最終回，賴慰玲（Winki）帶住囝囝也也深入婆羅州熱帶雨林，執行尋找傳說中「食人花」的驚險任務！呢種全世界最大嘅花原來摸一下隨時被罰款10萬港元，更會發出腐肉臭味，究竟佢哋最後有冇搵到？\n</p>\n<h2>Winki母子深入雨林 尋找全世界最大食人花</h2>\n<p>喺節目最終回，賴慰玲母子被委派一個極具挑戰性嘅任務，就係要深入婆羅州獨有嘅熱帶雨林，尋找全世界最大嘅花——大王花，亦即係俗稱嘅「食人花」。Winki解釋，所謂食人花其實只係探險小說穿鑿附會嘅講法，佢最大嘅特色係會發出好似腐肉嘅臭味，用嚟吸引小昆蟲作誘捕。可能因為聽得太多恐怖傳聞，囝囝也也表現得非常抗拒，唔敢觸碰呢朵巨型花朵。Winki親身觸摸後形容：「摸落去好厚硬」，觸感相當特別，整個尋找過程充滿神秘同刺激感。</p>\n<h2>Winki揭損壞大王花後果 隨時罰款10萬港元</h2>\n<p>今次尋找大王花嘅旅程唔單止係一次生態探索，更加係一堂寶貴嘅公民教育課。賴慰玲喺節目中特別提到，馬來西亞非常重視熱帶雨林嘅保育工作，對待大王花呢類珍貴物種更加係有嚴格嘅保護法例。佢嚴肅咁表示：「假如損壞大王花，有可能被罰 5 萬元馬幣（約 10萬港元）。」呢個驚人嘅罰款金額，令整個探索過程增添咗幾分緊張氣氛，母子二人都步步為營，唔敢亂掂周圍嘅植物，深刻體會到保育大自然嘅重要性，絕對係一次震撼教育。\n</p>\n<h2>轉戰婆羅州文化村 體驗獵頭族鑽木取火</h2>\n<p>離開危機四伏嘅熱帶雨林後，賴慰玲母子轉戰到婆羅州文化村，體驗當地獵頭族原住民嘅生活，繼續佢哋嘅學習之旅。呢一站嘅主要目的係讓囝囝也也認識人類嘅基本生存技能。喺當地人嘅指導下，也也親手學習鑽木取火，體驗古人嘅智慧。與此同時，Winki亦都喺呢度迎嚟自己嘅人生最大挑戰——生食西米蟲。由尋找珍稀植物到學習原始技能，整個行程都貫徹住「玩住學」嘅精神，令母子二人一齊面對同克服唔同嘅困難，共同成長。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚節目有意義 驚嘆大自然奇觀</h2>\n<p>呢集充滿獵奇同知識性嘅內容播出後，唔少網民都大讚節目非常有意義，同一般親子旅行節目好唔同。觀眾紛紛留言表示大開眼界：「呢啲親子節目先好睇，唔係淨係去主題公園。」、「個食人花好核突，但又好想親眼睇下！」、「罰10萬蚊！真係唔講唔知，摸下都唔得，好彩佢哋冇整爛。」亦有唔少網民大讚也也嘅表現：「也也好叻仔，咁細個就學識鑽木取火！」、「Winki真係好媽媽，帶個仔去體驗咁多嘢。」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1_14979894036ae037c87a2e0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1_14979894036ae037c87a2e0.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2_10409879686ae037d12bd7c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2_10409879686ae037d12bd7c.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3_1773389686ae037d9215ec.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3_1773389686ae037d9215ec.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4_1289949056ae037e2538b9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4_1289949056ae037e2538b9.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/5_4920871906ae037eb663b4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/5_4920871906ae037eb663b4.png\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%a9%e4%bd%8f%e5%ad%b8%e5%ad%b8%e4%bd%8f%e7%8e%a9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玩住學學住玩</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b3%b4%e6%85%b0%e7%8e%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">賴慰玲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a3%9f%e4%ba%ba%e8%8a%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">食人花</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3530935\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:32.189047+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1436,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:52.581772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:42.037177+00:00","content_hash":"ee7fc7c26533dfbc6875439a66d42ed64bd63bf377998bd2569ebb023ff24680","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}